---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "../../components/Container.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../../components/Eyebrow.astro";
import Button from "../../components/Button.astro";
import EndCTA from "../../components/EndCTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The founder"
  description="Tiffany Russell, founder of elefox studio. UX designer, product builder, AI tinkerer. Based in South Florida."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-2 md:pt-4 px-2 md:px-4">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden pt-28 md:pt-40 pb-12 md:pb-16 max-w-[1600px] mx-auto">
    {/* Portrait, sits behind the headline on lg+, clipped to the card.
        Cleanly stacks on mobile. */}
    <img
      src="/people/tiffany.webp"
      alt="Tiffany Russell, founder of elefox studio"
      class="hidden lg:block absolute top-24 right-0 w-[36vw] max-w-[520px] aspect-[4/5] object-cover object-[center_30%] pointer-events-none select-none z-[2]"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      decoding="async"
      width="600"
      height="750"
    />

    <Container size="full" data-reveal>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl lg:max-w-[44rem]">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8 md:mb-10 text-sm">
          <ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-graphite">
            <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-forest underline-offset-4 hover:underline">About</a></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-mist" aria-hidden="true">/</span><span class="text-ink" aria-current="page">The founder</span></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
        <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[0.95] text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl">
          Hi. I'm Tiffany. I started
          <span class="text-forest">elefox</span>.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-graphite">
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-ember inline-block"></span>
          Coral Springs, somewhere between coffee #2 and a deploy
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Mobile/tablet portrait, stacks below the headline, centered. */}
      <figure class="mt-12 lg:hidden mx-auto max-w-[360px]">
        <img
          src="/people/tiffany.webp"
          alt="Tiffany Russell, founder of elefox studio"
          class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover object-[center_30%]"
          loading="lazy"
          width="600"
          height="750"
        />
      </figure>
    </Container>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The story -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <Container size="default" data-reveal>
      <div class="prose-content space-y-8 text-lg md:text-xl text-graphite leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          I'm a UX designer and product builder based in Coral Springs, South
          Florida. I've worked across every flavor of the web (in-house,
          agency, freelance), and elefox is the studio I always wanted to run.
        </p>

        <p>
          What kept getting me hired wasn't one specialty. It was that I
          could figure out the plan, design it, and then write the code
          myself. A therapy practice that needed a real intake system. A
          realtor whose CRM was built for someone else. A financial planning
          firm that wanted a site that actually closed leads. It kept
          happening, so I built a studio around it.
        </p>

        <p>
          The studio is intentionally small. I'm the strategist, lead
          designer, frontend builder, and AI tinkerer on every engagement.
          A small group of collaborators I trust (engineers, illustrators,
          copywriters) plug in when a project calls for them. We cap our
          custom software roster at 25 active clients. We turn down work we
          can't make great. I'd rather do fewer projects really well.
        </p>

        <p>
          Years in, the part I still love is the same: making real things
          for people who needed something better than what was on offer.
          The tools have changed wildly. AI agents, modern frontend
          frameworks, and LLM pipelines are all in the kit now, and I keep
          learning the new stuff so what we ship doesn't feel dated two years
          after launch. The craft underneath hasn't changed one bit.
        </p>

        <p>
          The name? Long before it was a studio,
          <strong class="text-ink font-medium">elefox</strong> was my kids:
          elephants in my daughter's nursery, foxes in my son's, and a
          tattoo on my arm to keep them both close. When I needed a name
          that wasn't mine, theirs was the obvious one. The qualities happen
          to map, too: elephants remember and play the long game; foxes are
          clever and know when to bend the rules. That's how I want the
          studio to work.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Sign-off */}
      <div class="mt-16 flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-graphite">
          signed,
        </span>
        <span class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight text-forest">
          Tiffany
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick facts -->
      <dl class="mt-20 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 border-t border-fog pt-12">
        {
          [
            { t: "Based", d: "Coral Springs, FL" },
            { t: "Experience", d: "15+ years" },
            { t: "Toolkit", d: "Figma · Astro · Next.js · AI agents" },
            { t: "Studio focus", d: "Relationship-driven small teams" },
          ].map((item) => (
            <div>
              <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-forest mb-2">{item.t}</dt>
              <dd class="text-lg text-ink leading-snug">{item.d}</dd>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing -->
  <section class="py-6 md:py-12">
    <Container size="full">
      <div data-reveal class="bg-forest text-bone rounded-[28px] md:rounded-[40px] px-6 md:px-16 py-20 md:py-32">
        <Eyebrow tone="bone">A note</Eyebrow>
        <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display tracking-tight leading-tight mt-6 max-w-3xl text-bone">
          If you're reading this and wondering whether a small studio is the
          right call for your business, let's talk. The worst outcome is a
          free conversation. The best is the start of something that fits.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="/contact#book" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-bone text-ink rounded-pill text-lg font-medium hover:bg-cream transition-colors">
            Book a call
          </a>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-transparent text-bone border-2 border-bone/70 rounded-pill text-lg font-medium hover:bg-bone hover:text-forest transition-colors">
            Send a message
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
